# An AdaRace road.  One setting a line, then the points it runs through, closed
# back to the first: x  z  height  half-width  banking (metres, degrees; banking
# is positive when the right side is lower).  See "Your own roads" in the README.
name Storoe TT
kind circuit
# Round a made-up island on its public road: along the south coast, up through
# the S-bends to the moor, across the top, down the switchbacks of the west
# side and back along the shore into the harbour.  Narrow, bumpy and long:
# a road for the motorcycle.
# The sea along the south shore, and a bay on the west side
